          "quote": "我需要调取老人既往结肠肿瘤手术、小中风发作的相关住院/出院记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00025",
          "explanation": "Workspace returns repeated capillary glucose 30.7/32.3/33.3/HI, insulin pump, q2h monitoring, and endocrine consult.",
          "quote": "护士站末梢血糖:30.7 可能原因：高血糖 处理意见：胰岛素"
        },
